  "evidence": "TEXT_E: NHS and social care boosts (50,000 more nurses; mental health parity; social care funding and guarantee), victims' law and domestic abuse action; Get Brexit done, strengthen the Union, defence spending above 2% and Trident, veterans support; 20,000 more police, tougher sentencing, voter ID, maintain First Past the Post; environment and animal welfare measures; points-based immigration prioritising skills and contribution, contribution before benefits. TEXT_D: 1p income tax rise ringfenced for NHS and social care; mental health waiting time standards and 24/7 crisis care; end fuel poverty, Clean Air Act, insulation; fix Universal Credit, scrap two-child limit, end rough sleeping; Stop Brexit/Remain, federal UK and stronger devolution; curb mass surveillance and police facial recognition, end disproportionate stop and search, PR and votes at 16; strong equality and rights expansions; climate emergency plan (net zero 2045, renewables, ban fracking).",
